                "assessment": "finish polls once, takes pending, creates sockets/parts/native center, maps owned error to String and stores by original requested key. Pending protects corresponding body from trim, supporting direct body lookup. Successful attach publishes sockets then hidden render parts and resolved root; whole model/native readiness not implied by root tag."
              },
