                "ranges": "System.Object[]",
                "assessment": "Each update finishes pending, computes worn outfits, derives key from LastFit first/current fallback. Global failure marks all presentation roots failed/resolved. Invalid selection/outfit calls fail_fit; matching current+resolved skips work. Changed key installs before resolve. Thus pending result remains cache-associated with request rather than blindly attached to current placeholder; per-update current key selection controls attachment."
              },
              {
                "ranges": "System.Object[]",
                "assessment": "fail_fit removes root FitKey, hides and tags failed/resolved; it does not remove LastFit or item socket state here. resolve retrieves cached model or tags cached error; otherwise starts next fit after shape preparation and stores String on failure. install removes existing procedural children and sockets, writes new root FitKey and item LastFit BEFORE fitting succeeds. Requested versus successful LastFit meaning requires explicit policy; do not assume its name means committed success."
